["Nivel 28: vuela a Orgrimmar y entrena con Sorek: Abrumar (rango 2), Atronar (rango 3) y Represalias (rango 2). Al hablar con el instructor elige entrenar: la guía aprende sola lo recomendado (Mayús para hacerlo a mano)."]="Level 28: fly to Orgrimmar and train with Sorek: Overpower (rank 2), Thunder Clap (rank 3) and Retaliation (rank 2). When you talk to the trainer choose to train: the guide learns what is recommended on its own (Shift to do it by hand).",
