["Nivel 28: vuela a Orgrimmar y entrena con Ur'kyo, en el Valle de los Espíritus: Explosión mental (rango 4), Tortura mental (rango 2), Peste devoradora (rango 2). Al hablar con el instructor elige entrenar: la guía aprende sola lo recomendado (Mayús para hacerlo a mano)."]="Level 28: fly to Orgrimmar and train with Ur'kyo, in the Valley of Spirits: Mind Blast (rank 4), Mind Flay (rank 2), Devouring Plague (rank 2). When you talk to the trainer choose to train: the guide learns what is recommended on its own (Shift to do it by hand).",
